        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBR8040, 8\" Solid Brass Wire Basket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA wire basket such as this is perfect for all sorts of storage needs. It is easy to install and is available in 5 beautiful finishes ranging from modern to traditional. Made by Deltana, the WBR8040 8\" wire basket is constructed out of solid brass with the attention to high quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR8040-specifications.gif?v=1704354669\" width=\"574\" height=\"388\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBR8040 8\" Wire Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBR8040 Solid Brass Rectangular Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBR8040.pdf?v=1704262292\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBR8040 8\" Wire Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
